From 4f7e72628963343c16034326564ebac7fd5e8b0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 02:48:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Prepare Sodium's draw batches for the light's render
 lists

Terrain cast no shadows on 26.3: the shadow map held only what is drawn
outside Sodium. Sodium for 26.3 builds a region's draw commands in
prepareChunkRendering rather than inside the draw, and the shadow walk
replaces the camera's render lists with the light's, which clears every
region's batch. The light's draws then found every batch empty. Run
prepareChunkRendering for the light's lists inside the shadow stage,
where face culling is already lifted, before drawing them.

Checked on a controlled superflat scene against Vitrail 0.11.0-beta on
26.2: the shadow map goes from ~900 drawn texels to ~1.2M, and the slab
and log shadows match 26.2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019Rd9hEeedfauYVxKQg5jqi
---
 .../main/java/dev/vitrail/sodium/ShadowTerrain.java    | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/common/src/main/java/dev/vitrail/sodium/ShadowTerrain.java b/common/src/main/java/dev/vitrail/sodium/ShadowTerrain.java
index c6be9f9..9cebefa 100644
--- a/common/src/main/java/dev/vitrail/sodium/ShadowTerrain.java
+++ b/common/src/main/java/dev/vitrail/sodium/ShadowTerrain.java
@@ -316,6 +316,16 @@ private static void draw(SodiumWorldRenderer renderer, Minecraft minecraft, Vec3
 				((GameRendererStorage) minecraft.gameRenderer).sodium$getProjectionMatrix();
 		ChunkRenderMatrices matrices = new ChunkRenderMatrices(projection, MODEL_VIEW);
 
+		// Sodium for 26.3 no longer builds a region's draw commands inside the draw: it fills them
+		// in prepareChunkRendering, from whatever render lists stand, and the camera's call to it ran
+		// long before this stage. The walk above has since put the light's lists in their place,
+		// and resetting a list clears every batch its region holds, so without a prepare of its own
+		// the light's draws below find nothing in any batch and the shadow map keeps only what is
+		// drawn outside Sodium. Run inside the shadow stage so the face culling is lifted for it, as
+		// the light needs every face. The camera's walk at the top of the next frame rebuilds its
+		// lists, which clears these again, and its own prepare refills them.
+		TerrainDraw.shadowPass(() -> renderer.prepareChunkRendering(matrices, camera.x, camera.y, camera.z));
+
 		// The game's own chunk sampler, mipmapped and clamped, and it is NOT what the pack's shadow
 		// programs read the atlas through: the renderer hands this to begin, where the chunk
 		// renderer mixin settles the pack's sampler for every pass, this one included, so the shadow
